WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.060
SHINING SOUL

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:40.840
What a refreshing morning.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.540
Good morning, President.

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:50.960
What happened? Wasn't that Takao-kun's voice just now?

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:53.600
Takao overslept and just wouldn't wake up, so...

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:58.350
Takao! Wake up, it's time to go!

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:01.330
Leave him be. It's his fault for staying up late.

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:02.370
Come on!

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:04.370
Okay, leave this to me.

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:16.020
I'm sure <i>that</i> woke him up alright.

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:17.410
Here he is.

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:20.840
Uh? Takao's still sleeping?

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:24.260
Sorry, I went too far. He lost consciousness.

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:31.820
The deadline for the registration is close, we should hurry and take off.

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:33.620
Go ahead without me.

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:36.560
It's my fault that he's in this state.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:39.530
I'll catch up to you as soon as he wakes up.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:40.470
Is that so?

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:42.860
Well, see you at the Stadium.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.530
Curry!

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:50.530
Loss By Default? The Stranded BBA Team

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:58.270
Professor, you look tired.
Did you stay up all night again?

00:02:58.740 --> 00:02:59.390
Yes...

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:04.880
That's right! I finally completed your new Draciel and Shooter.

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.450
New Draciel and Shooter?!

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:11.010
Wow! Incredible, when did you find the time..?

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:15.350
I kicked your Draciel's defensive power up a notch.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:21.980
As for the Shooter, I implemented a new system that will make your shots more accurate. I call it Sniper Grip.

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.250
Will you use them?

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:28.130
Thank you, Professor! Of course, I'll happily use them!

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:31.380
A new Draciel... <i>Yahoo!</i>

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:37.820
How does it feel in there, Genbu's Bit?

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.450
Let's get along, my new Draciel!

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:49.110
President! Can I go first at the semi-finals? I want to test the power of my new Draciel!

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:54.560
I don't mind. I will put you down in first place when we register.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:56.800
<i>Okay!</i> I'm going to do it!

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:59.840
Professor! Thank you, thank you, thank you!

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.360
Seriously..?

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:12.700
Putting a chili pepper in my mouth just because I overslept? Come on...

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.310
It's <i>your</i> fault for not waking up, Takao!

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:20.610
Oh? Isn't that one of the buses heading to the Stadium?

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:22.240
Let's hop in.

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.590
We're saved!

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:28.180
Hey, bus driver, halt! I mean, stop!

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.870
Looks like the audience is even bigger than usual today.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:50.470
Indeed, these people are all here to see you fight at the semi-finals. And they will keep coming.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:53.070
I will go register our team.

00:04:57.570 --> 00:05:00.480
Uh? Where is Rei-nii?

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:03.490
Isn't he here yet?

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.680
How long before we get to the Stadium?

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:09.140
It's going to take a while.

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:12.110
Man, I want to fight already...

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.980
What kind of guys are we going to face at the semi-finals?

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.030
Your battles aren't going anywhere.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.290
Uh? Why are we stopping?

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.410
What's with this traffic jam?

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.810
Most likely people going to the Stadium.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:34.240
This many?!

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:36.990
It's the semi-finals of the Asian Tournament.

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:40.150
Even more people will go to see the finals, I bet.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:44.200
Wow... And we get to fight there? It's incredible!

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.810
Still, something about this traffic jam feels off.

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:50.660
Rei! Do you see anything?

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.080
This is..!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.560
Takao and rei sure are late...

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:58.750
The battles will begin any minute now!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.300
I-It's terrible!

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:02.000
The road we came through..!

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:05.650
A landslide?!

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:06.770
So it seems.

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:09.180
The road is completely shut off.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:11.650
This explains this jam.

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:14.400
What do we do?! The match is about to begin!

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:18.260
And it's all my fault for oversleeping...

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:20.250
I'm not gonna stay up late ever again!

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:22.740
We're not going to make it to the match!

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:23.490
What do we do?!

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:24.690
We run..?

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:27.620
Run..? You think we'll make it in time if we do that?

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:31.960
If we cross this mountain and run straight ahead, the Battle Dome should be close by.

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:35.410
We're supposed to cross this mountain?!

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.490
What, getting cold feet?

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:38.590
No, let's go!

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:41.640
Our battles are waiting beyond this mountain!

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:44.710
Let's run! For my Bey, be it
a mountain or a valley, I'll cross it!

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:50.050
That's so like you, takao. Well, it's a mountain path, but it's a mere 10 kilometers.

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.610
10 kilometers..?!

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:00.460
What should we do?

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.530
The match is about to <i>start</i>.

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:06.830
The only thing we can do now is
pray that, while Max is fighting,

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:12.040
the landslide will be fixed and Takao-kun and Rei-kun will be able to get here safe and sound.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.340
But what if they don't make it in time..?

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:16.030
It's starting!

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:26.960
Are you okay, Takao?

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:29.460
Yeah! This is nothing!

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:34.980
Get away, Takao!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:41.200
Rei!

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:43.700
Did it hit you?

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:47.010
No... But I think I sprained my ankle.

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:51.330
Takao, go ahead without me. If you get past this cliff, all that's left is the descent.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:54.460
Don't be stupid! How can I leave you like this?!

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:57.190
I can't run with my leg in this state!

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:59.440
You can still make it in time for the battle!

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:01.520
I can't abandon my friend!

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:04.630
Rei, you just saved me from that falling rock.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:07.050
It's <i>my</i> turn to save you now!

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:09.050
Takao..!

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:12.720
Get on. We have to climb across this cliff.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.050
Here we go!

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:16.720
Ladies and Gentlemen!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:20.400
The second match of the semi-finals is here!

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:25.570
Whoever wins this match will advance to the finals and face the Chinese team!

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:28.310
The two teams that will fight for this right are...

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:32.350
The Maldivian team and the BBA team!

00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:36.530
Oh? The BBA team is missing some members..?

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:42.700
Are all the other members in the bathroom? The fights will begin any minute now!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.700
They're in the bathroom!

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:48.710
I bet they're nervous, these <i>are</i> the semi-finals after all.

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:51.480
What are Rei-nii and his friends doing?

00:08:53.640 --> 00:08:59.060
What in the world are you doing? The fight is about to start!

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:00.280
Takao, Rei!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:09.640
The hatch is now opening and the Battle Stadium is revealing its appearance as the battle begins.

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:18.290
This time the Beyblades will be able to express all their potential in this Standard-type Battle Stadium!

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:23.930
It's starting..! What do we do now, Draciel?

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:44.260
Alright, we're almost there.

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:46.700
Takao, are you okay? Don't push yourself too hard.

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:50.980
Don't you worry. We're going to meet the others.

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:53.140
Let's go!

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:01.410
Wait for us, guys!

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:26.440
The first battle will see Max from the BBA team face Ibrahim from the Maldivian team!

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:29.280
Takao, Rei... Hurry up!

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:32.280
Alright, let's begin the first battle!

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:33.390
<i>What?</i>

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:36.970
That Bey... It's covered in scratches!

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:38.370
Here we go!

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:39.110
Three! Two! One!

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:41.580
<i>Okay!</i> Let's do this!

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:43.910
Go... Shoot!

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:49.160
Oh, they're going to clash head-on!

00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:58.520
His guard is so solid!

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:00.810
<i>Wow!</i> Amazing <i>defense</i>!

00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:05.650
Yes! This is the biggest feature of the new Draciel!

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:10.980
Go!

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:16.340
The <i>defense</i> has been <i>especially</i> strengthened!

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:18.860
The new Draciel that the Professor made for me!

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:20.690
Yor name will be...

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:21.360
I know!

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:26.240
Draciel Shield!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:29.490
Alright! Go, Draciel Shield!

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:30.250
What?!

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:37.810
Wow! Is Max going to win with
just one move of his Draciel?

00:11:37.810 --> 00:11:39.300
Okay, Draciel!

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:42.250
Oh wait... I can't win this quickly,

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:44.820
I have to drag this out until Takao and Rei get here.

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:54.260
Okay! I can still fight!

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:57.100
Wheew! <i>Safe.</i>

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:59.030
What's with him?

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:07.020
Takao, are you okay?

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:13.260
I can see it... It's right there, and yet we're not getting any closer!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.520
Why you..!

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:21.250
Takao, that's enough. You go alone...

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:26.240
Don't make me repeat myself. We're friends, aren't we? We're going to get there together.

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:29.210
The stadium is right there...

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:40.270
We have to buy some time, Draciel!

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:51.730
Stop running away and fight!

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:54.890
Come on, fight! Don't be a coward!

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:57.680
I...

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:02.840
Kiki, where the heck were you?

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.420
I was in the bathroom...

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:07.140
I knew it!

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:10.880
You don't think we are worthy opponents, is that it?!

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:15.350
It's true. In our country, there wasn't any Beyblade.

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:20.230
The only Beyblade we had, was one that some tourist had forgotten there.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:21.280
But still..!

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:25.640
We trained with everything we had, and we got all the way to the semi-finals!

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:30.240
And yet, you..! You aren't fighting me seriously!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:32.660
Ibrahim! <i>No!</i> You've got it wrong!

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.340
What did I get wrong?!

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:35.350
I..!

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:36.460
I am just..!

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.230
Max, are you fine with that?

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:41.550
Dragging out a fight just to buy time...

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:44.900
As a Beyblader, are you fine with that?!

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:45.810
Kai...

00:13:46.270 --> 00:13:51.810
Fighting with all you've got, no matter the circumstances... Isn't this what being a Beyblader is about?

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:52.770
Kai!

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:58.320
Kai is completely right.

00:13:58.320 --> 00:14:01.770
How could I do something so shameful?

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:03.780
Ibrahim!

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:09.870
Is it too late... to let me
<i>fight</i> against you with all I have?

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:12.340
I was waiting to hear you say that.

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:14.720
Okay! <i>Go</i>, Draciel!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:19.600
Go, our Beyblade!

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:20.920
This is it!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:21.870
This is the stuff!

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:23.620
This is what we wanted to see!

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.650
Now <i>this</i> is a Bey Battle!

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:31.310
Let's go with the move inspired by the sea of our country, Dive Attack!

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:34.920
Dive, dive deep underwater!

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:42.930
This is..!

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:45.500
Welcome to the sea of our country, the Maldives!

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:49.120
Draciel!

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.160
This is the end!

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:54.820
Not yet!

00:14:54.820 --> 00:15:00.500
The new Draciel that the Professor made for us, my own power, and the Bit's power...

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.450
Let's show them to him, Genbu!

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:11.520
This is our power!

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:12.730
What..?!

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:23.590
Oh! Will the Maldivian team be saved again by a lucky rebound?

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:34.580
Max wins the match!

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.540
We did it, Draciel Shield!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:38.170
Professor!

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:39.350
Max!

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:42.470
The BBA team wins the first battle.

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:45.680
How will the second battle go?

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:49.190
Both teams, get ready to fight!

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:53.940
Takao and Rei aren't going to make it after all..?

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:57.700
What's wrong, BBA team? It's Rei's turn now.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:01.320
What's going on with the BBA team?

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:07.970
DJ, the truth is... We can't...

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:09.170
I will go.

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:13.280
I should have been registered as the backup member.

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:16.790
The rules allow substituting players.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:18.510
Yes, that's true.

00:16:18.730 --> 00:16:22.640
So Kai will fight in place of Rei. Is that correct?

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:25.270
Yes it is. Let's start.

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:27.110
Kai!

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:33.380
For the second battle, the BBA team replaces Rei with Kai, who will fight his first match in this tournament.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:36.720
The Malidivian team sends out Avdol.

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:38.930
Okay, let's do this!

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:45.090
Three, Two, One!

00:16:45.090 --> 00:16:46.850
Go... Shoot!

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:55.650
Do it, Dranzer!

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:12.850
It's a perfect victory for Kai!

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:14.770
B-Beyond amazing!

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:16.550
As expected from Kai-kun.

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:19.860
With this, the BBA team has won two rounds.

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:23.040
Now, will the Maldivian team turn the tides?

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:23.940
The third battle—

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:25.740
We renounce to the third battle.

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:29.110
You plan to win by running away?! I haven't fought yet!

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:32.810
This will mean defeat for your team, are you okay with that?

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:34.340
A defeat for our team?

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:39.700
The BBA team has already won two rounds, so shouldn't losing the third match by default not matter?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:47.650
The team and its members are one and the same. If one member retires, it's the same as if the whole team did.

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:50.980
Now, let's proceed with the third battle!

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:51.760
Oh no!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:54.500
Okay...

00:17:56.020 --> 00:18:01.350
BBA team, I suggest you hurry up. If you don't fight, it will count as a renounce.

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:03.850
Ugh, there is nothing more that can be done.

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:08.610
Kai even fought for us, are we
really going to lose like this..?

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:24.260
DJ! I'm the contestant for the third battle!

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:25.770
Sorry for being late!

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:29.160
Uhm, will you be alright? I mean, with those bruises and whatnot.

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:36.240
I'm alright, DJ. I will fight together with my friends!

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:39.180
That's why I am here now!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:40.690
Takao!

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:42.970
So he finally woke up.

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:48.100
How the heck did they get here?! The road should be completely blocked!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:50.720
Kiki! Again with the underhanded tricks?!

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:54.450
Stop, Kiki! I'm going to tell on you to Lai-nii!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:56.540
Kiki!

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:58.540
Sorry... to keep you waiting.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:03.950
Well then, let's go.

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:07.720
Three, Two, One!

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:10.580
Go... Shoot!

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:20.560
It's over! With this, The BBA team earns a spot at the finals!

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:30.980
Now I see...

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:35.010
You have some great friends, Rei-nii...

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:39.030
I'm looking forward to the finals.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:46.500
Man, I'm pooped. I'm never
gonna oversleep again in my life!

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:52.090
I was really afraid back then. We're finally at the finals, aren't we?

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:56.000
Hey...

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:01.300
You know... <i>I'm sorry</i>.

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:03.810
For what? Don't worry about it.

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:06.450
Seems like you had a lot going on.

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:10.810
I don't know if it will count as an apology, but I have a <i>present</i> for you.

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:12.720
Will you accept it?

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:15.540
Are you sure?

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:21.400
It was my Beyblade, but I'm sure you'll treasure it.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:26.260
Yeah.

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:29.680
Of course we will treasure it. Thanks.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:34.140
Max!

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:38.380
The next time we fight, let's go all out from the start!

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:39.940
<i>Okay!</i>

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:44.900
Still, to think that Kai would fight for the team...

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:48.940
He acts like that, but in reality he thinks of us as friends.

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:51.060
Don't misunderstand.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:57.230
If <i>you guys</i> lose here, <i>I</i> will lose my chance at facing off against the Sacred Beast users from around the world.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:59.900
I just lent you my power to that end.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:03.600
Either way... Thank you, Kai.

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:08.420
He's <i>so</i> not cute!

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:25.020
Alright! Next up is our final match against the Chinese team!

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:26.240
Let's do this!

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:28.020
Yeah!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.700 --> 00:23:02.180
According to my analysis, we have arrived at the finals of the Asian tournament at last!

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:04.860
The first match is Max versus Gaou.

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:09.280
That's lucky! Against that spaced out Gaou, winning will be like a walk in the park!

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:11.840
Or so we thought, but that was a big mistake!

00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:16.340
He is as powerful as a mountain bear!

00:23:16.340 --> 00:23:19.760
Next time: Final battle! Aiming for the Top of Asia!

00:23:19.760 --> 00:23:21.580
Max, you have to <i>bear</i> this!

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:23.880
Wait, this is no time for puns!
